 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. CONDS2.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01  A   PIC 9(3).
 01  B   PIC 9(3).
 01  S   PIC S9(3).
 01  T   PIC X(5).
 01  RT  PIC X(30) VALUE "------------------------------".
 01  RT2 REDEFINES RT.
     05  R   PIC X OCCURS 30.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     MOVE 5 TO A. MOVE 7 TO B.
     IF A >= 5 MOVE "Y" TO R(1) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(1).
     IF A >= 6 MOVE "N" TO R(2) ELSE MOVE "Y" TO R(2).
     IF A <= 5 MOVE "Y" TO R(3) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(3).
     IF B <= 6 MOVE "N" TO R(4) ELSE MOVE "Y" TO R(4).
     IF A NOT = 6 MOVE "Y" TO R(5) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(5).
     IF A IS GREATER THAN 4 MOVE "Y" TO R(6) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(6).
     IF A IS LESS THAN B MOVE "Y" TO R(7) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(7).
     IF A EQUAL TO 5 MOVE "Y" TO R(8) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(8).
     IF A NOT LESS THAN 6 MOVE "N" TO R(9) ELSE MOVE "Y" TO R(9).
     IF A GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 5 MOVE "Y" TO R(10)
         ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(10).
     IF A LESS THAN OR EQUAL TO 4 MOVE "N" TO R(11)
         ELSE MOVE "Y" TO R(11).
     IF A = 1 OR A = 5 AND B = 7 MOVE "Y" TO R(12)
         ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(12).
     IF (A = 1 OR A = 5) AND B = 9 MOVE "N" TO R(13)
         ELSE MOVE "Y" TO R(13).
     IF NOT (A = 1 OR B = 1) MOVE "Y" TO R(14) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(14).
     IF A = 1 OR 3 OR 5 MOVE "Y" TO R(15) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(15).
     IF A = 1 OR 2 MOVE "N" TO R(16) ELSE MOVE "Y" TO R(16).
     IF A > 1 AND < 10 MOVE "Y" TO R(17) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(17).
     IF A > 1 AND < 5 MOVE "N" TO R(18) ELSE MOVE "Y" TO R(18).
     MOVE "12345" TO T.
     IF T IS NUMERIC MOVE "Y" TO R(19) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(19).
     MOVE "12A45" TO T.
     IF T IS NOT NUMERIC MOVE "Y" TO R(20) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(20).
     MOVE "ABC" TO T.
     IF T IS ALPHABETIC MOVE "Y" TO R(21) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(21).
     MOVE -3 TO S.
     IF S IS NEGATIVE MOVE "Y" TO R(22) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(22).
     IF S POSITIVE MOVE "N" TO R(23) ELSE MOVE "Y" TO R(23).
     MOVE 0 TO S.
     IF S IS ZERO MOVE "Y" TO R(24) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(24).
     MOVE 0 TO A.
     PERFORM UNTIL A > 3 OR A = 2
         ADD 1 TO A
     END-PERFORM.
     IF A = 2 MOVE "Y" TO R(25) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(25).
     EVALUATE TRUE
         WHEN A = 1 OR 3 MOVE "N" TO R(26)
         WHEN A = 9 OR 2 MOVE "Y" TO R(26)
         WHEN OTHER MOVE "N" TO R(26)
     END-EVALUATE.
     IF A = 2 AND (B = 1 OR B = 7) AND NOT A = 3
         MOVE "Y" TO R(27) ELSE MOVE "N" TO R(27).
     DISPLAY "YYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYY---".
     DISPLAY RT.
     STOP RUN.
